@host = http://localhost:3000
@cookie = next-auth.session-token={{SESSION_TOKEN}}
@userId = user-id
@featureId = feature-id
@permissionId = permission-id
@eventId = event-id

# Dica de setup local:
# 1) Rode npx supabase start
# 2) Rode npm run db:prepare-local
# 3) Login com admin@sistema.local / ChangeMe123!
# 4) Use os IDs impressos pelo seed para userId, featureId e eventId

### [0] Health check local
GET {{host}}/api/system/status

### [0.1] Setup check (DB + tabelas criticas)
GET {{host}}/api/system/setup

### [1] Access - listar features
GET {{host}}/api/access/features
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### [1.1] Users - listar usuarios (para obter userId)
GET {{host}}/api/users
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### [2] Access - criar feature
POST {{host}}/api/access/features
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{
  "key": "agenda:read",
  "name": "Agenda leitura",
  "description": "Permite consultar agenda",
  "route": "/agenda",
  "showInMenu": true,
  "showInDashboard": true,
  "sortOrder": 10,
  "enabled": true
}

### [3] Access - listar permissoes customizadas
GET {{host}}/api/access/permissions
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### [4] Access - criar/atualizar permissao por usuario
PUT {{host}}/api/access/permissions
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "featureId": "{{featureId}}",
  "canAccess": true
}

### [5] Access - remover permissao customizada
DELETE {{host}}/api/access/permissions
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{
  "permissionId": "{{permissionId}}"
}

### [6] Agenda - listar com filtros, paginacao e ordenacao
GET {{host}}/api/agenda?startsFrom=2026-04-01&startsTo=2026-04-30&ownerQuery=admin&page=1&pageSize=10&startsAtSort=asc
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### [7] Agenda - criar evento
POST {{host}}/api/agenda
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{
  "title": "Reuniao de operacao",
  "description": "Revisao semanal",
  "startsAt": "2026-04-18T10:00:00.000Z",
  "endsAt": "2026-04-18T11:00:00.000Z"
}

### [8] Agenda - atualizar evento
PATCH {{host}}/api/agenda/{{eventId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{
  "title": "Reuniao atualizada",
  "description": "Revisao semanal atualizada",
  "startsAt": "2026-04-18T10:30:00.000Z",
  "endsAt": "2026-04-18T11:30:00.000Z"
}

### [9] Agenda - remover evento
DELETE {{host}}/api/agenda/{{eventId}}
Cookie: {{cookie}}

# Uso:
# 1) Preencha SESSION_TOKEN
# 2) Opcional: ajuste host
# 3) Atualize userId/featureId/permissionId/eventId conforme seu ambiente
# 4) Execute em ordem para smoke test manual
